  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukongs-wibble-wobble-ride-v6-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "d9fe3481d5f3f5932b33fc37de04560dd9807a55e4b69034ebba59b6738e9960",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a8a617472a7e1bce351cd17111400e8e644477338d020d0a4e33204a4eb60bca",
      "text": "悟空的\n摇摇晃晃\n自行车",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2d1d22e2312d315d3daeb5bcaef7e8c86c292105dae983f83101d7f33e54b093",
      "text": "“哇，他们骑得多神气！”\n悟空的尾巴高高翘起来。\n“我也想骑！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f208f55a56fd0ac2f1ac7e9cbc985c6c4a1e11ad05b08b8cf883432bf4db1f4c",
      "text": "悟空戴上头盔。\n“准备好啦！”\n“嗯……戴反了！”\n悟空咯咯笑。\n“再试一次！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e593eefab7f6565ea5386abfcc43e7d0ee025ccdc4e3383b73a4c985ed275a54",
      "text": "悟空用脚蹬着地。\n蹬一下，滑一段。\n“哈哈，像滑板车一样！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0f708e35e995059788ee43046468d03d41be91844eb6c2fe867c02d290ffb244",
      "text": "双脚刚抬起来，\n车就左晃右晃。\n扑通，坐进草丛里！\n“哎哟，草地接住我啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1a3160fbfa9e9473bc47914fd3e36656177b889928e4ceb19f6b957b58c223d3",
      "text": "“按按铃，也许就不晃啦。”\n叮铃！叮铃！\n铃铛倒是响了，\n车子还是晃呀晃。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "614d16a105f373774955d4c5da1e51ad50ba87de2da3b153ea10855e731dbf47",
      "text": "八戒扶住车座。\n“眼睛看前面，慢慢来。”\n玉兔在旁边喊：\n“你能行！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1054e6d3e04a84c69a9eacd58f3453a0ad6e07d066818c2fca2a01c45b4c4b33",
      "text": "悟空又试了一次。\n蹬地，出发！\n踩一下脚踏板，\n再踩一下。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "40c698242dcb3d03a62cd6bd166894a99c7c40b334866f46942e1f5701f45ac5",
      "text": "他往左边晃，\n尾巴往右边晃。\n“我的尾巴也在学呢！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2b62031dcedcb057a6a60f8afe303eab484c8f0d9d506202ff9b7bbb80999cf1",
      "text": "他每天都练一会儿。\n有时只能骑一小段，\n有时还是晃呀晃。\n他每天都再试一试。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "33c0e2c4894abaf756b92fd656d2b26e83f57db3a29318f8f912d746e0cd75d6",
      "text": "有一天傍晚……\n八戒松开了手。\n悟空还在往前骑！",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "fd8ed833260a851536174847550157ccc28f6e1b53432fad9d33df9c70822376",
      "text": "“我会骑啦！”\n他的围巾飘呀飘，\n尾巴绕了个圈。\n悟空高兴得不得了。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d928c0487a28e065c3647b0b51cf32163f20f9e4ebd9c0c1f1097cccd831043e",
      "text": "他学会了转弯，\n也学会了停车——\n就停在水坑前。\n“小鸭子，你先走。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9feb787e7c8823828964fbd82d87612db16c8397425c159df93128e5d87463aa",
      "text": "现在，他们一起骑车。\n不着急，\n轮子骨碌碌地转。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "bb00b9635e06b58b9dd94f74e9ca3f4080293fc7ea6c183bc4fe58e286492f04",
      "text": "回到家，悟空停好车。\n“晚安，小自行车。\n今天就骑到这儿啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5077be1a38f08bc6c8e42b8acffddc766cb9a310ea351f95cacd68d7be9a370f",
      "text": "悟空在床上蜷成一团。\n梦里的小路平平整整，\n轮子轻轻地说：\n“嘘……”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5fe2412537ab0ab9a468f8fb7e11a30b221231ff6b956d3c19f2625a27017f1",
